## Code readability profile

Meanings: `docs/framework/POLICY.md` ("Project profiles"). The `backend`, `frontend`, `backend-reviewer`,
`frontend-reviewer`, `database-architect` and `reviewer` agents read this file.

> Selected profile: **{{MID-LEVEL | SENIOR | pending}}** (decided by {{who}}, {{date}})

- **MID-LEVEL** — explicit, straightforward, easy to follow and debug, conservative with abstraction.
- **SENIOR** — stronger abstractions allowed only when justified; readability stays mandatory either way.

Reviewers have senior-level expertise but judge code against the selected profile; they do not demand
needless abstraction.

